What value is returned by `compute(3, 4)`?

```javascript
function compute(x, y) {
  let sum = 0;
  for (let i = 0; i < x; i++) {
    for (let j = 0; j < y; j++) {
      if ((i + j) % 2 === 0) sum += i + j;
    }
  }
  return sum;
}
```

